# Twinblade Blessing: "Flash. Enchant creature. Enchanted creature has double strike." Bot1 attacks with Isamaru (2/2) and only
# then casts the Aura, with the three mana of Black Lotus, in the declare attackers step (Flash, CR 702.8a): it is refused on a Mox
# Pearl (not a creature, CR 303.4a) and accepted on Isamaru, which has double strike for the rest of combat and, unblocked, deals 2
# in the first-strike damage step and 2 again in the regular one (CR 510.4, 702.4b): Bot2 goes 20 -> 16.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Isamaru, Hound of Konda
Twinblade Blessing
Island x3
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Isamaru, Hound of Konda.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Isamaru, Hound of Konda.Keywords = (absent)
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Isamaru, Hound of Konda > Bot2)
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
! Bot1.Hand.Twinblade Blessing.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl)
Bot1.Hand.Twinblade Blessing.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Isamaru, Hound of Konda)
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Isamaru, Hound of Konda.Keywords = DoubleStrike
? Bot1.Battlefield.Twinblade Blessing.AttachedTo = Isamaru, Hound of Konda
